<!--
  Three pages, not twenty. The wiki deliberately has no sitemap of its own: it lives on a different
  host path (github.com/.../wiki) and listing it here would claim ownership of pages this repo does
  not serve.
  ⚠️ `404.html` is deliberately absent — it carries `<meta name="robots" content="noindex">`, and a
  sitemap entry for a page that asks not to be indexed contradicts it.
  ⚠️ `support/` was MISSING until 2026-11-14 while the 404 page linked to this file with the words
  "Sitemap — every page on this site". It listed two of the four pages that exist, and the one it
  omitted was the only one that asks for money. A sitemap is a claim about what the site publishes.
  ⚠️ Update the <lastmod> dates only when the page content actually changes — a sitemap that lies
  about freshness is a spam signal, not a ranking one.
-->
